{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relocat is a narrative 2D adventure about relocation, growing up, everyday life, and attention to small things.<br><br>You\u2019re a kitten who left home and is starting from scratch. Earn a living with gift orders: find the right items, pick combinations that fit the recipient, and wrap them with care\u2014the quality affects both payment and the recipient\u2019s reaction. Use your earnings to pay rent, eat, and slowly make your room your own. Talk to neighbors, read letters from home, deal with sudden setbacks\u2014and see how they change you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gift-making as work. Scavenge locations for items \u2192 assemble the requested set \u2192 a timing/precision wrapping mini-game \u2192 evaluation and the recipient\u2019s response.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyday life matters.</strong> Hunger, energy, and mood affect available actions and efficiency; your home and found collections help keep balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices and lines.</strong> Conversations with characters shape your attitude toward relocation and what \u201chome\u201d means.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home as an anchor.</strong> Collected items remain in the interior and build a personal story.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944590?t=1759574969","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/1cbe6543e9c3d9a828024c1a836142cc6980936b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759574969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/4a97e16f592940d983783aa3b4cfcaa8c8bf62ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759574969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944590/4a97e16f592940d983783aa3b4cfcaa8c8bf62ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759574969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"